WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit in Hero on the left side — left foot beside the left hip, right leg extended.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Bend the right knee and hold the right foot with both hands.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Inhale and extend the right leg up, foot flexed.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the spine long; draw the leg in only as far as the back stays tall.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Release and switch sides.
